      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INDIGO PEARL (5) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (30.18) in a Grade 5 at Gosford. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Can make amends. RAVEN FLY (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Maitland behind Shadow Assassin (25.34) in a Mix. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Bold showing expected. SERGEANT DUKER (7) is worth forgiving last start after finishing seventh (26.00) in a Grade 5 at Maitland over 450m. The form out of his last race has been franked. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. NEED AN ALIBI (4) is in the mix after placing last time out.",
